### HTTP requests file: in Visual Studio / VS Code ("REST Client" extension)
### click "Send Request" above each request to try it.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### All projects (with task count)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects

### Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Thesis"
}

### All tasks of a project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?projectId=1

### Only "InProgress" tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks?status=InProgress

### A specific task
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1

### Non-existent task -> 404 ProblemDetails (GlobalExceptionHandler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/9999

### Create a task -> 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review LINQ",
  "description": "Where, Select, Include, GroupBy",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": "2026-11-05T00:00:00Z",
  "projectId": 1
}

### Invalid task (empty title) -> automatic 400 from [ApiController]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "priority": "Low",
  "projectId": 1
}

### Update the whole task (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Study DI lifetimes (updated)",
  "description": null,
  "status": "Done",
  "priority": "High",
  "dueDate": null
}

### Move a task to another column (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done"
}

### Delete a task -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks/3
